OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt isolated from normal life
OL,4,Aafter suffering a stroke at 22'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp until spring 2025, the life of
OL,7,Fcontent creator and PR executive Saskia
OL,8,FBishop was a glamorous whirlwind.
OL,10,FWhen she was not unboxing beauty
OL,11,Fproducts on social media, she could be
OL,12,Ffound enjoying herself at gigs or
OL,13,Fjetting off to Paris with her friends
OL,14,Ffor the city's fashion week.
OL,16,FThat all changed on 21 April last year,
OL,17,Fwhen the then-22-year-old fell ill with
OL,18,Fa terrible headache after getting off a
OL,19,Frollercoaster at a theme park in
OL,20,FSouthend, Essex.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
