OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt isolated from normal life
OL,4,Aafter suffering a stroke at 22'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just got this massive sharp bang in
OL,7,Fmy head. It was like a bomb had gone
OL,8,Foff," said Saskia, who lives between
OL,9,FWorcester and Gloucester.
